64659752124", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630198_2577186362552498_3913228803140222976_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cz9NnFtGL1EQ7kNvwGrfv_g&_nc_oc=Ado23P5A2MNDG4eND5Rm7QdF9Mt8zGr-8Chq5pSnzcArbhWwBpQjfO1RbQNS27RNP0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB_lJKoUey8xttxaoTwXXBDY9ODXaljEeimeOqWUCrPTw&oe=6A58C4DD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "561784124443343", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458099_2270787786557926_9182956901405556736_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bX-7mEgWnYgQ7kNvwFfKm4b&_nc_oc=AdruuYe9zZUT1fZskfUQ2zeZc6rbENeZgaB6NtQgtyuOqs73bmtAZ5113uSnTkPem6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA1ga_b2j7IeFNzO1xFI1mvZlffFrMZQTRmW8vhKVErgw&oe=6A58CE37"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "224781318713799", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_523290235257100_254597187336404992_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qoRWE9wtbO8Q7kNvwEQ3RaS&_nc_oc=AdrxE-Mb9-H7BwalyhlQWsoolpPWH_c4oC6zh1z7AGM52xrd3GxVcTKa1Ewl7e_WnL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAYw5kynBSUgk6hStijSENnLBOutgARn9ZieBcaF8Cv7g&oe=6A58F416"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster - Epic Bat Shooting Game", "keywords": ["Epic", "Roller", "Coaster", "Shooting", "Game"], "long_description": "Ready to experience the real adventure of Epic Roller Coaster with a new feature of bat shooting? Indulge in one of the most refined, immersive and energetic VR coasters you\u2019ve ever seen!\nIf you don\u2019t want to go for a most spooky adventure, then you can also enjoy the peaceful ride of Fantasy Roller Coaster! \nThere are 3 modes to have the fun of Epic Roller Coaster:\n1.\tSimple Peaceful Ride\n2.\tHaving Controls on Speed \n3.\tBat Shooting Mode\n\nIf you have any feedback, feel free to share. More and long